[{"title":"松棚歌奉次涯翁先生","author":"邵宝","text":"涯翁壮游尽南东，品题到处皆留踪。\n老閒逸事情亦钟，笔底云气成巃嵷。\n乾坤奇观此卷中，有歌落落称棚松。\n眼前烟雾如郁葱，野无夏屋胡为幪。\n胡不梁柱明光宫，君子若人能固穷。\n周旋地占五十弓，脱去尘土将腾空。\n上辞鹳鹤下蛇虫，天留奇崛当严冬。\n实看纠结虚玲珑，蟠根定与东海通。\n不然何以游群龙，在渊在陆天机同。\n多言莫如图画工，神品妙得吟哦功。\n使君骢马缨垂红，偶入野寺披蒙茸。\n閒将手剔古苔封，行遍天涯亡是公。\n几回世上儿成翁，青云后拥风前冲。\n工师过眼徒憧憧，岂复斤斧遭樵童。\n松兮如鸟已出笼，时来贵客僧鸣钟。\n寻常曲直嗟麻蓬，谁将此物惊盲聋。\n涯翁诗成五色虹，突然平地起危峰。\n南来吏牍兼诗筒，知音千里如相逢，雅哉淇澳非卫风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46643,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水北山庄图歌","author":"邵宝","text":"近来善学孟端画，眼中吾许张临湘。\n临湘病后作此幅，树色惨淡山苍苍。\n水北山人好事者，要我题诗惠泉下。\n秋林逝矣不可招，临湘临湘亦其亚。\n菊有黄华夜榻深，长吟偶坐吾玉林。\n樽前击节与未已，谁能和以无弦琴。\n听松庵里庐山壁，少日相看眼双碧。\n酒酣且作山人歌，莫向山僧问畴昔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46644,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金山行送林提学之山西","author":"邵宝","text":"大江之中，有峰崔嵬。\n屹然独立不可动，百川到此皆萦回。\n乾坤风气，与水相移推。\n来今往古无断续，中间有阖复有开。\n顺流直泻忽此突然者，俨如玄圭锡禹戴履参三才。\n吾闻岷山导江，东沱北汇，茫然两涯。\n瞿塘谁为峡，滟滪谁为堆。\n洞庭东去小孤小，又东千里行绕凤凰之高台。\n南徐望海只尺是青天，如宇置此坳堂杯。\n兹峰非柱亦非碣，清泠隔绝人间埃。\n神宫佛刹半参倚，唐镌宋刻剥落生莓苔。\n蛟龙隐盘窟，鸾鹄栖悬崖。\n上摩苍茫下临空洞兮，不可以测度，但见海有西户江有东南隈。\n一山二水理应尔，嗟此卷石直从何地天将来。\n水神夜戒百灵护，万骑驱逐疾走如衔枚。\n吁嗟乎，尾闾去终日，昆崙几时回。\n振陵风雨潮汐争喧豗。\n大哉吾道一逝者，夫何为乎有澜日倒波今颓。\n若非藉此作孤障，彼狂且悍将谁与之裁。\n吾人定力如此石，沧桑不变此石无倾隤。\n送君须上最高处，商声击石开君怀。\n太行绝顶更回首，一航东海何如哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46645,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"貘皮行","author":"邵宝","text":"客从巴东至，遗我一兽皮。\n观之非虎非熊罴，三十年前尝见之。\n貘哉貘哉古白泽，蜀中诸山多窟宅。\n嚼铁复吞铜，他物更何择。\n独出不知云雾深，狂奔但恨林原窄。\n辟邪亦袪湿，此语自古闻，今夕何夕来吾门。\n貘乎貘乎汝诚武，吾将高坐论斯文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46646,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"容春轩六咏 其一 瞻尼坛","author":"邵宝","text":"画里瞻尼父，庭前即杏坛。\n春风吹绿树，真作泗滨看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46647,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"容春轩六咏 其二 拟渠井","author":"邵宝","text":"横渠复古心，纸上聊云尔。\n我画我中庭，亦复横渠纸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46648,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"容春轩六咏 其三 先春台","author":"邵宝","text":"两树分红白，同然见复心。\n开花还结子，吾道古犹今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46649,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"容春轩六咏 其四 晚秋圃","author":"邵宝","text":"秋菊有黄花，有朱亦有素。\n靖节醉东篱，为识花心故。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46650,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"容春轩六咏 其五 鼋峰庭","author":"邵宝","text":"万古水中山，一峰山下石。\n古貌独苍然，不受风涛蚀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46651,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"容春轩六咏 其六 钟石沼","author":"邵宝","text":"石钟以声名，无声安取此。\n风水月明中，我忆东坡子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46652,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇赠赵宅之","author":"邵宝","text":"苦热思高眺，王孙胜有楼。\n城阴连塔影，山月入溪流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46653,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"显上人送茶题扇荅之","author":"邵宝","text":"祛暑方静坐，茶来清我心。\n铜槃小泉石，绿树一堂深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46654,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻歌 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"久不闻山歌，南风五月多。\n牧童呼伴侣，吹笛下西坡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46655,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻歌 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"久不闻水歌，溪上夜如何。\n一声长复短，隐隐度烟波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46656,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书国臣扇","author":"邵宝","text":"有物能生风，如云起太空。\n飒然凉似水，人在玉堂中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46657,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题国英扇","author":"邵宝","text":"看竹不问主，听松还对僧。\n山中春欲暮，此兴复谁曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46658,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得月为星士作","author":"邵宝","text":"与客讲虚中，明月照我怀。\n怀中亦有月，元从天上来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46659,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题琴泉","author":"邵宝","text":"手弄朱丝弦，音从太古传。\n山中无和者，幽涧落寒泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46660,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伯川以生日诗来口占代柬","author":"邵宝","text":"谢客不谢诗，谢诗应太俗。\n笑舞老莱衣，高歌对慈竹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46661,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋日许东庐过我至晚乃固辞去口占一绝","author":"邵宝","text":"君因赏月来，赏心不赏月。\n一夜冉泾船，千古王猷雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46662,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为张云邱题画用其韵","author":"邵宝","text":"梦里诗情远，閒中笔力长。\n云邱本孤绝，更爱竹风凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46663,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"知微病口占问之","author":"邵宝","text":"秋雨山僧病，经旬我不来。\n夜来来老圃，报我桂花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46664,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吴鹰扬","author":"邵宝","text":"湖上初逢地，城中再会年。\n白头今老矣，青眼故依然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46665,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒日斋居次见素公韵","author":"邵宝","text":"供茶须地栗，和药谢天麻。\n山鸟投风树，江鸥避雪沙。\n近招醪饮薄，远劄绢封斜。\n深巷临泾曲，弦歌自一家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46666,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李白夫","author":"邵宝","text":"他日兰溪上，相知尚未深。\n东山千里梦，南国两年心。\n长路看孤剑，高枝待上林。\n朱弦寥落久，三叹对希音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46667,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祠山庙火诗以吊之兼慰孔道士","author":"邵宝","text":"古庙前朝建，咸淳纪在碑。\n千金未足惜，一火竟堪悲。\n回禄增邻戒，嘉平罢里祠。\n羽人愁且病，风雨夜何其。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46668,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送浦文玉会试","author":"邵宝","text":"雪色照行李，江帆影碧空。\n壮怀离别外，长策对扬中。\n风转扶摇上，星回斗柄东。\n济时公等在，吾道付冥鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46669,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘介夫四川提学","author":"邵宝","text":"蜀道兵戈后，君行为作人。\n冬深方度腊，江远故从岷。\n钟鼓堂坛曙，旌旗道路春。\n锦川明似镜，天与照风神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46670,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慈寿为林镇江赋","author":"邵宝","text":"名郡临江表，思归未得归。\n遥持扬子水，剧舞老莱衣。\n秋壁寒逾峻，春阳远更晖。\n徵黄仍汉典，重诰到慈闱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46671,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日试笔荅浦文玉","author":"邵宝","text":"轻著风吹柳，深将雨裛花。\n诗筒春有草，砚滴海无涯。\n历纪还元日，车书正一家。\n晴洲堪共眺，新水荻生芽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46672,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明日叠前韵","author":"邵宝","text":"秀句传新岁，应知笔梦花。\n昏初回斗柄，春已遍天涯。\n有客真徐孺，多书岂邺家。\n朝来看草色，隐隐在根芽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46673,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东庐见过","author":"邵宝","text":"客从寒日至，下榻对梅花。\n它夜月千里，伊人水一涯。\n病怀违酒社，老兴托诗家。\n再过须为约，春茶渐有芽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46674,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又用韵柬南沙","author":"邵宝","text":"有风门独掩，寒径久无花。\n客舫维城角，吾庐傍水涯。\n閒将寻奕者，静复谢禅家。\n茗碗何堪供，山童掘笋芽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46675,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈严州嘉言","author":"邵宝","text":"旧守持新节，江边问睦州。\n春星观雨驾，秋水济川舟。\n风濑迎驺骑，云山带驿楼。\n范公公所慕，到处得追游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46676,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠余鸿宾","author":"邵宝","text":"晚领儒官檄，真成阙里游。\n诸生今复鲁，吾道故从周。\n冻雨随春作，凉云接海浮。\n古松看挺拔，应待栋梁求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46677,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文玉送双莲有诗将之次韵为荅 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"水国秋风早，双莲若为携。\n对时占举首，观物兴思齐。\n茹苦辞熊胆，行空信马蹄。\n相看清露溢，仙掌不须梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46678,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文玉送双莲有诗将之次韵为荅 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"投我清心物，筠笼故故携。\n如闻歌和越，真解味忘齐。\n甘露分松顶，香风逐骏蹄。\n高登餐沆瀣，从此是阶梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46679,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋莲走笔荅文玉","author":"邵宝","text":"秋莲如晚子，应有物持携。\n双玉价难并，群珠数已齐。\n色鲜浮露羽，香远逐风蹄。\n太液九天上，朝来何处梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46680,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢生荔次友人","author":"邵宝","text":"有客传闽荔，怀君我更携。\n时和成地胜，物论待人齐。\n蜜荐连龙眼，尘封谢马蹄。\n因思南极贡，航海复山梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46681,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻东所讣","author":"邵宝","text":"东所不可作，其如海月何。\n百年清静坐，一日激昂歌。\n夜雨梅山道，春风赣水波。\n白沙遗像在，老泪欲滂沱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46682,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李司训","author":"邵宝","text":"九载成贤日，超迁在此行。\n飞龙重睹象，鸣鹿屡闻声。\n雨露春方早，江湖晚更晴。\n东山读书处，回首有馀情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46683,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊花庄一首寄吴宪使","author":"邵宝","text":"东篱千古意，今在野桥东。\n乘兴者何客，忘机有此翁。\n关河雄镇后，风雨醉吟中。\n我亦开吾径，秋来得几丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46684,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述事用澹成韵","author":"邵宝","text":"世事弦歌外，吾庐揖让中。\n竹深云冉冉，苔滑径重重。\n我独观生理，人徒问坐功。\n秋深苦多雨，真欲讼云龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46685,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再用韵荅文玉兼赏佳句 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"秋月将弦夜，林居自老身。\n社无邀酒地，里有和诗人。\n照隐看悬鉴，穷玄拟驾轮。\n一明千里共，爱子笔如神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46686,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再用韵荅文玉兼赏佳句 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"诏侍宁亲日，弦歌报主身。\n静中真乐地，病后有閒人。\n月水双涵镜，风天一转轮。\n达观无不可，碌碌恐劳神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46687,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见新月用前韵","author":"邵宝","text":"独恨中秋月，年年照病身。\n星边槎有客，江上笛何人。\n兔影还双杵，蟾光欲半轮。\n万峰天柱顶，愁坐正驰神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46688,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣夜用前韵","author":"邵宝","text":"吟遣初长夜，愁将久病身。\n地宽吾爱我，天远此怀人。\n北共星从极，西生月在轮。\n披衣还起坐，无汨是存神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46689,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅文玉","author":"邵宝","text":"诗到谣还步，秋庭落细花。\n百年双老眼，一代几名家。\n烟径兼疏雨，风溪带浅沙。\n不知城郭外，何处更清华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46690,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再荅文玉","author":"邵宝","text":"有客题新句，吴笺动墨花。\n市桥南北巷，邻屋两三家。\n江水初辞峡，溪金故出沙。\n病夫饶古意，极力谢浮华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46691,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"分胙馈东庐","author":"邵宝","text":"病起乾坤大，秋分日夜中。\n山花还我径，露草更天风。\n膰俎分清庙，诗筒寄野翁。\n南楼明月夕，谁与一樽同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46692,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠针医罗某","author":"邵宝","text":"百年江海兴，南粤又东吴。\n陈榻还曾否，骞槎信有无。\n神功人掷杖，隐计市悬壶。\n归到仙岩下，重看五岳图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46693,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵荅顾与成","author":"邵宝","text":"寺忆重游处，僧房古涧阴。\n诗坛曾有意，禅榻本无心。\n未敢忘周梦，焉能和越吟。\n思君时极目，湖上两云岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46694,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次杨支硎题惠山泉韵","author":"邵宝","text":"公来多逸兴，胜赏独于斯。\n水德元无滓，山灵故有知。\n泠深方汲绠，瀑远自降旗。\n古调谁能和，风湍下石池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46695,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以云南芥菜送文玉文玉有诗用韵荅之","author":"邵宝","text":"病起亲畦菜，常怀饭我恩。\n有方能入药，无和未成飧。\n迹比䲭蹲野，心忘鴳适樊。\n慈闱亦知味，吾不愧曾元。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46696,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再荅文玉","author":"邵宝","text":"殊方传美种，雨露共天恩。\n菹已供时荐，羹还劝客飧。\n梦基君亦蔡，学圃我应樊。\n莫道冰霜地，微阳复起元。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46697,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿华甥夕话斋与许东庐叙旧","author":"邵宝","text":"坐共青灯榻，真成夕话哉。\n暄凉才问昨，晴雨未知来。\n腊放诗人笔，春分野老杯。\n梅花应识我，相对一徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46698,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送徐提学","author":"邵宝","text":"两浙多才地，三年化雨深。\n何人悲枥马，有客赋镕金。\n歌向胥潮听，书从禹穴寻。\n旧游吾所愧，棠树未成阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46699,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇赠侯刑部用姚少师泉上韵","author":"邵宝","text":"三日金陵道，江船趁晓开。\n泉甘容我住，山重为公来。\n石愧元章拜，桑怜著作栽。\n冬深初雨雪，春色已盈杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46700,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泉上次姚少师","author":"邵宝","text":"江左此亭古，原泉若为开。\n龙嘘山雨动，鱼跃水风来。\n菉竹曾闻赋，金莲不见栽。\n晋人如可作，此地复流杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46701,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宁庵少宗伯见过","author":"邵宝","text":"病后相逢处，犹疑十载前。\n君行当要路，吾道在寒泉。\n轩坐风初静，城居地偶偏。\n麻姑坛可到，谁共赋游仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46702,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谢景州","author":"邵宝","text":"财赋南畿郡，文章太学官。\n清为舆论重，老觉仕途难。\n台斗天何近，沧瀛地本宽。\n董祠千载后，再拜肃衣冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46703,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕过南沙南沙有诗用韵奉荅","author":"邵宝","text":"月比昨宵昏，阶墀尚有痕。\n主人将就榻，童子正敲门。\n市上灯初静，斋中席旧温。\n阿咸能从我，病力独乘轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46704,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"以泉寄宁庵将之以诗","author":"邵宝","text":"星汉孤槎畔，风涛二月前。\n不来今雨客，聊寄此山泉。\n使出乡关便，家从驿道偏。\n曾闻路人语，尘世有登仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46705,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"薏苡粥次涯翁韵荅张提学","author":"邵宝","text":"旧是南方物，新从北塞传。\n两封何郑重，万颗自匀圆。\n入剂堪充使，加餐漫拟仙。\n无心成故事，涯老赋诗年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46706,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中怀侯世卿","author":"邵宝","text":"半月黄梅雨，怀人意独深。\n吟长唐省漏，梦远宓堂琴。\n活水通泾曲，甘棠散野阴。\n泉亭千古胜，留眼共登临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46707,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叠前韵","author":"邵宝","text":"不枉河阳驾，东亭草径深。\n雨馀方策杖，风至自鸣琴。\n病榻忘周梦，郎曹惜禹阴。\n未须嗟室远，时有简书临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46708,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次浦文玉对池荷 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"超然不见埃，池上见花开。\n华岳诗中望，庐峰梦里回。\n江湖吾道在，坛席若人来。\n逸调难为和，天工自剪裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46709,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次浦文玉对池荷 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"朝露洒炎埃，红渠相映开。\n色深从水出，香远遂风回。\n华国将移去，怀人幸折来。\n江南多旧曲，知是女郎裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46710,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]